  "body": "There's some useful commentary in https://github.com/w3ctag/design-reviews/issues/229#issuecomment-424390065 not all of which is captured by other issues. In particular:\r\n\r\n* Remove the outdated mailing list advice.\r\n* Perhaps replace \"useless\" with \"historical\" (although the usage of it was meant to convey \"has no use\" it's apparently taken to mean useless' more informal derogatory meaning).\r\n* Link \"get the parent\" issue.\r\n* Explain why `attachShadow()` has the safelist it has.\r\n\r\n(The IDL remarks don't have an issue, but they shouldn't be addressed at this level, as they affect all IDL standards.)",
